<title>GERMANY: Dresdner 96 profit rise above 10-15 pct.</title>
<headline>Dresdner 96 profit rise above 10-15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG's operating profits will rise faster than 10 to 15 percent in the current year, a spokesman for Germany's second largest commercial bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The profit rise would be &quot;certainly not just 10 or 15 percent&quot;, the spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Earlier, Dresdner said it expected a clear double digit rise in its operating profits this year. Its nine-month operating profits rose 29.7 percent to 1.89 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
